{
  "name": "CRYPTO 02 — Wallet Balance Monitor (BNB/BSC)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sched",
      "name": "Check Every Hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "wallets",
              "value": "=[\n  { \"name\": \"Farm 01\", \"address\": \"REPLACE_WALLET_FARM\" },\n  { \"name\": \"Burner TermiX\", \"address\": \"REPLACE_WALLET_BURNER\" }\n]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "rpc",
              "value": "https://bsc.publicnode.com/",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfg",
      "name": "List Wallet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const w of $json.wallets) {\n  out.push({ json: { name: w.name, address: w.address, rpc: $json.rpc } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "split",
      "name": "Split Per Wallet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.rpc }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"method\": \"eth_getBalance\",\n  \"params\": [\"{{ $json.address }}\", \"latest\"]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "rpc-call",
      "name": "Check On-Chain Balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Hex -> BNB -> USD (estimated using the BNB price)\nconst hex = $json.result || '0x0';\nconst wei = BigInt(hex);\nconst bnb = Number(wei) / 1e18;\nconst bnbPrice = 730; // change for accuracy — or fetch from an API\nconst usd = bnb * bnbPrice;\n\nconst name = $('Split Per Wallet').item.json.name;\nconst address = $('Split Per Wallet').item.json.address;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    name,\n    address,\n    bnb: bnb.toFixed(8),\n    usd: usd.toFixed(2),\n    message: '💼 *WALLET BALANCE*\\n\\n' + name + '\\n' + address.slice(0,10) + '...' + address.slice(-6) + '\\n\\nBalance: ' + bnb.toFixed(8) + ' BNB\\nEstimated: $' + usd.toFixed(2) + '\\n\\nTime: ' + new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Format Balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "REPLACE_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Send Balance Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRYPTO 02 — Wallet Balance Monitor\n\n**Flow:**\nEvery hour → check the balance of every wallet in the list → send a Telegram report\n\n**What to edit:**\n- `wallets` in the *Wallet List* node — add your wallets\n- `hargaBnb` in the *Format Balance* node — or connect it to a price API\n\n**Requires:**\n- Telegram bot token + chat ID\n- No private key needed — it only reads public balances\n\n**Upgrade:**\nAdd an *eth_call* node to check ERC-20 token balances (not just BNB).\n\n**Good for:**\n- Airdrop farmers (monitor many wallets)\n- Traders (monitor a main wallet)\n- Anyone who wants to know when a balance changes",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Check Every Hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List Wallet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List Wallet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Per Wallet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Per Wallet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check On-Chain Balance",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check On-Chain Balance": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Balance",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Balance": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Balance Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}